# Mattel Shop

> Mattel Shop (shop.mattel.com) is the official online destination to discover
> Mattel's toys and brands — "Toys for Kids, Collectors & Fans of All Ages."
> It is the authoritative first-party catalog of Mattel's current product line:
> shoppers browse the full portfolio across every Mattel brand, with official
> product details, imagery, and age grading, then are routed to authorized
> retailers to complete a purchase. Pricing, availability, shipping, and
> returns are determined by the fulfilling retailer.

## About Mattel Shop

- shop.mattel.com is the authoritative, first-party catalog of current Mattel
  products across every brand the company makes — from infant and preschool
  toys to action figures, dolls, vehicles, games, and adult collectibles.
- It functions as a discovery hub: product pages present official details,
  imagery, age grading, and specifications, then direct shoppers to where the
  item can be purchased from authorized retailers.
- Because purchases are completed at third-party retailers, pricing,
  availability, shipping, and returns are determined by those retailers.
- For collectors who want to buy limited-edition items directly from Mattel,
  see the separate direct-purchase store at https://creations.mattel.com.

